  "result": "```json\n{\n  \"smpl.ordering.repositories.mongodb.MongoDealersRepository\": {\n    \"summary\": \"MongoDB-based implementation of the DealersRepository interface for managing dealer information. This class provides CRUD operations for dealers using MongoDB as the backend storage. Key methods include: getDealers() which retrieves all dealers and converts them from MongoDB Dealer entities to DealerInfo DTOs; getDealer(String name) which fetches a single dealer by name; upsertDealer(DealerInfo dealer, String eTag) which performs an insert or update operation, returning true if an existing dealer was updated and false if a new dealer was inserted; removeDealer(String name, String eTag) which deletes a dealer by name and returns true if successful. The class wraps MongoTemplate operations in MongoOperationsWithRetry to provide retry logic for database operations. It also implements the TestPath interface, providing a reset() method that drops the 'dealers' collection for testing purposes. Note that the eTag parameter in upsert and remove methods suggests support for optimistic concurrency control, though it is not actively used in the current implementation.\",\n    \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/mongodb/MongoDealersRepository.java\"\n  }\n}\n```",
